# Import boundaries

Enforced by the `frontend-architecture` ESLint plugin. Policy tables:
`eslint/architecture.config.mjs` (layer imports) and `eslint/package-boundaries.config.mjs`
(package ownership). Never work around a boundary error — move the code.

- Cross-module imports ONLY via `@/modules/<feature>` (the module `index.ts`). Deep imports
  like `@/modules/articles/services/article.service` from another module are banned
  (`no-cross-module-deep-imports`).
- `src/app` imports containers/components from modules and shared; it never contains logic.
- Layer direction inside a module: containers → hooks → queries/store → services → gateway →
  mappers. Services and gateways are React-free. Components import nothing but props types
  and design-system primitives (`no-restricted-layer-imports`).

# Package owners (digest)

Import the wrapper, never the vendor (`no-raw-package-imports`):

| Vendor | Wrapper | Key exports |
| --- | --- | --- |
| axios | `@/packages/axios` | `httpClient`, `HttpError`, `isHttpError`, `normalizeToHttpError` |
| @tanstack/react-query | `@/packages/query` | `useAppQuery`, `useAppMutation`, `useAppSuspenseQuery`, `AppQueryProvider` |
| zustand | `@/packages/zustand` | `createAppStore`, `useAppStoreShallow` |
| zod | `@/packages/zod` | `z`, `parseSchema`, `safeParseSchema` |
| dayjs | `@/packages/date` | `formatDisplayDate`, `formatRelativeToNow`, `toIsoString` |
| react-hook-form | `@/packages/forms` | `useAppZodForm` |
| next-intl | `@/packages/i18n` | `useAppTranslation`, `getServerTranslations`, `AppIntlProvider` |
| sonner | `@/packages/toast` | `showToast`, `AppToaster` |
| lucide-react | `@/packages/icons` | named `*Icon` exports only |
| clsx + tailwind-merge + cva | `@/packages/ui-primitives` | `cn`, `Button`, `Input`, `Card`, `Alert`, `Stack` |
| react-virtuoso | `@/packages/virtuoso` | `VirtualizedList` |
| next/link, next/image, next/navigation | `@/packages/link`, `@/packages/image`, `@/packages/navigation` | `AppLink`, `ExternalLink`, `AppImage`, `useAppNavigation`, `appRedirect`, `appNotFound` |
| env / browser / storage / console | `@/packages/env`, `@/packages/browser`, `@/packages/storage`, `@/packages/logger` | `publicEnv`, `getServerEnv` (server), `getSafeWindow`, `readStorageJson`, `appLogger` |

Full map with rationale: `context/package-boundaries.md` and `rules/09-library-wrapping.md`.
Wrapping something new: `skills/create-package-wrapper.md`.
